data.content:
## What Changed

ASP.NET Core 10 upgraded from **Microsoft.OpenApi v1** to **v2**, which targets OpenAPI 3.1 (JSON Schema). Key breaking changes:

| .NET 9 (OpenApi v1) | .NET 10 (OpenApi v2) |
|---|---|
| `OpenApiString`, `OpenApiInteger`, etc. | `JsonNode` (`System.Text.Json.Nodes`) |
| `schema.Example` is `IOpenApiAny` | `schema.Example` is `JsonNode?` |
| `schema.Nullable = true/false` | `schema.Type` is a `JsonSchemaType` flags enum; add/remove `JsonSchemaType.Null` |
| `ReferenceType.SecurityScheme` | `ReferenceType.SecurityScheme` still exists but `Reference` property moved — use `OpenApiSchemaReference`/`OpenApiSecuritySchemeReference` |
| `new OpenApiSecurityScheme { Reference = ... }` | `new OpenApiSecuritySchemeReference("oauth2")` |

## Fixed Code

```csharp
using System.Text.Json.Nodes;
using Microsoft.OpenApi.Models;
using Microsoft.OpenApi.Models.References;

options.AddOperationTransformer((operation, context, ct) =>
{
    var param = operation.Parameters.FirstOrDefault(p => p.Name == "api-version");
    if (param is not null)
    {
        // IOpenApiAny → JsonNode
        param.Schema.Example = JsonValue.Create("1.0");
    }

    operation.Responses ??= new Dictionary<string, OpenApiResponse>();
    operation.Responses.TryAdd("401", new OpenApiResponse { Description = "Unauthorized" });

    // OpenApiSecurityScheme { Reference = ... } → OpenApiSecuritySchemeReference
    var oAuthScheme = new OpenApiSecuritySchemeReference("oauth2");
    operation.Security = new List<OpenApiSecurityRequirement>
    {
        new() { [oAuthScheme] = scopes }
    };

    return Task.CompletedTask;
});

options.AddSchemaTransformer((schema, context, ct) =>
{
    if (schema.Properties is not null)
    {
        foreach (var property in schema.Properties)
        {
            if (schema.Required?.Contains(property.Key) != true)
            {
                // Nullable property removed; strip Null from the Type flags
                property.Value.Type = property.Value.Type & ~JsonSchemaType.Null;
            }
        }
    }
    return Task.CompletedTask;
});
```

## Summary of fixes

1. **`OpenApiString` → `JsonValue.Create(...)`** — all `OpenApiAny` types are gone
2. **`Nullable = false`** → remove `JsonSchemaType.Null` from the `Type` flags enum
3. **Security scheme references** → use `new OpenApiSecuritySchemeReference("oauth2")` instead of manually setting `Reference` + `ReferenceType`
4. **Add `using`s** for `System.Text.Json.Nodes` and `Microsoft.OpenApi.Models.References`
